    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710970/extras/cbb3a1ff50070824b10e6cac36f7dd6f.avif?t=1728542203\" width=602 height=153 /></span><br>Inspired by Monster Girl's Labyrinth, Dungeon Vixens is a dungeon crawling rouge-like monster girl adventure with retro graphics. You play as a lone protagonist with a quest to reclaim his love.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710970/extras/c64074582b29fc29d5db1153947513a1.poster.avif?t=1728542203\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710970/extras/c64074582b29fc29d5db1153947513a1.gif?t=1728542203\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710970/extras/dda96a7f58024462e776f23cdd268678.avif?t=1728542203\" width=602 height=153 /></span><br>The dungeon he is about to enter however is filled with a lot of temptations and challenges. Such as the Succubus Lilura and many other sexy vixens that roam the halls. Using your attack and defense slider system timing is everything.<br><br>Will you mend your heart or be lost forever in a Vixen filled dungeon of lust and pleasure?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710970/extras/74672104f10e38e7d5e6efdc1480c1b1.avif?t=1728542203\" width=602 height=153 /></span><br>- Mysterious and intricate labyrinth setting, filled with hidden secrets and challenges.<br>- 18 Challenging Levels with over 90 minutes of gameplay and even more to obtain all treasures of the dungeon.<br>- Over 20 monster girls each with their own styles and sex scenes!<br>- Many challenges and secrets buried within the tunnels to discover!<br>- Minigames within the walls of the dungeon: Slot Machines &amp; other interactive elements.<br>- Multiple Endings depending on the players choices including a SECRET ending.<br>- 5 Trading Cards &amp; 6 Achievments!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710970/extras/c1b8607b6d771028fb5e15c7cc569576.poster.avif?t=1728542203\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710970/extras/c1b8607b6d771028fb5e15c7cc569576.gif?t=1728542203\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>All characters of Dungeon Vixens: A Tale of Temptation are 18+ and over",
